  "limits": [
    "Public container entry supports Ogg Vorbis I. Other Ogg codecs and Vorbis in other containers are not implicitly claimed.",
    "Lookup2 and nonzero mapping/time transforms are rejected at the original pinned decoder boundary; lookup0/1, floor0/1 and residue0/1/2 are implemented.",
    "Compatible Ogg chains retain the original decoder overlap/header history. Output rate/channel/layout changes are rejected for the fixed-format Faster-Whisper consumer.",
    "Ogg page CRC, packet continuation and sequence are checked. Corrupt/truncated streams may raise ValueError where native FFmpeg tries concealment.",
    "Singular source-valid floor0 LSP products can produce original NaN/infinity values. Those native cases remain in qualification and are not silently discarded.",
    "A source-rate frame/seconds limit bounds decoded output; this Python GENERIC implementation has no real-time throughput guarantee."
  ],
